      "illus": null,
      "svg": "<svg viewBox='0 0 240 120' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'><g><path d='M18 80V47L55 22L92 47V80Z' fill='#EDE4D3' stroke='#2F4D7A' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M39 80V55H68V80M22 47H88' fill='none' stroke='#8A8178' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M30 75L75 50' stroke='#C8553D' stroke-width='3'/></g><path d='M120 82.00H227M122 20V85' fill='none' stroke='#8A8178' stroke-width='1.2'/><path class='draw' pathLength='1' d='M122.00 53.00L124.04 54.16L126.08 55.32L128.12 56.46L130.16 57.60L132.20 58.72L134.24 59.83L136.28 60.91L138.32 61.96L140.36 62.99L142.40 63.98L144.44 64.94L146.48 65.85L148.52 66.72L150.56 67.54L152.60 68.31L154.64 69.03L156.68 69.68L158.72 70.27L160.76 70.80L162.80 71.25L164.84 71.63L166.88 71.93L168.92 72.15L170.96 72.29L173.00 72.33L175.04 72.29L177.08 72.14L179.12 71.90L181.16 71.55L183.20 71.10L185.24 70.53L187.28 69.85L189.32 69.05L191.36 68.12L193.40 67.07L195.44 65.90L197.48 64.58L199.52 63.13L201.56 61.54L203.60 59.81L205.64 57.92L207.68 55.88L209.72 53.69L211.76 51.34L213.80 48.82L215.84 46.14L217.88 43.29L219.92 40.26L221.96 37.05L224.00 33.67' fill='none' stroke='#2F4D7A' stroke-width='2.6'/><circle class='pop' style='--d:.2s' cx='173.00' cy='72.33' r='4' fill='#C8553D' stroke='#C8553D' stroke-width='2'/><circle class='pop' style='--d:.2s' cx='224.00' cy='33.67' r='4' fill='#C8553D' stroke='#C8553D' stroke-width='2'/><g font-family='sans-serif' font-size='11.5' fill='#2A2522' text-anchor='middle'><text x='120' y='101'>낮아지다가 x=1에서 높아져요</text><text x='120' y='116'>최소 1m, 최대 5m</text></g></svg>",
      "title": "곡선 지붕 모형에서 낮은 곳부터 찾으려면?",
